message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying manuscript and this software release."
title: "Code and source data for APOE isoform-defining variant analyses of AD-AMD opposing pleiotropy"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-26
authors:
  - family-names: Yang
    given-names: Zhenglin
    affiliation: "First School of Clinical Medicine, Guangdong Medical University"
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: Jinlei
    affiliation: "First School of Clinical Medicine, Guangdong Medical University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mystrs-MY/apoe-ad-amd-pleiotropy"
repository-artifact: "https://github.com/Mystrs-MY/apoe-ad-amd-pleiotropy/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22102006"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package containing analysis code, configuration files,
  redistributable derived results, and figure-level source data for a study of
  APOE isoform-defining variants, opposing pleiotropy between Alzheimer's
  disease and age-related macular degeneration, and the detectable boundaries
  of circulating-protein mediation. Controlled and third-party input data are
  not redistributed.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - APOE
  - Alzheimer disease
  - age-related macular degeneration
  - Mendelian randomization
  - proteomics
  - genetic epidemiology
